    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Attractive 4 bedroom detached home in Grangerath.\r\nNo. 3 Park Rise is a beautifully presented four-bedroom detached family home offering spacious, well-balanced accommodation in a superb setting. This impressive property has been thoughtfully designed to cater for modern family living, with bright, generously proportioned rooms throughout.\r\nThe ground floor comprises a stunning double height entrance hall with a feature window leading to two elegant reception rooms, providing flexible living space. At the heart of the home is a spacious open-plan kitchen and dining room, ideal for everyday family life . A separate utility room and guest WC complete the ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are four generously sized bedrooms, including a beautiful main bedroom with floor to ceiling mirrored wardrobes and an en-suite shower room. A stylish family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms, ensuring ample space and comfort for growing families.\r\nExternally, the property enjoys excellent kerb appeal with a cobblelock driveway providing off-street parking for two cars. To the rear, the private south-west facing garden boasts a decked patio area that is perfect for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply enjoying the afternoon and evening sunshine.\r\nIdeally located close to a host of local amenities, schools, shops and transport links, this exceptional home offers everything a discerning purchaser could wish for.\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this wonderful family home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall: Wooden floor, double height entrance with feature window, understairs cloakroom.\r\nLiving room: 4.8m x 3.4m, bay window, wooden floor, built in stove.\r\nFamily room: 3.6m x 3.2m, wooden floor with double doors leading to:\r\nKitchen/dining room: 7.2m x 3.6m Modern, stylish kitchen with range of wall and floor units, tiled floor, gas hob, integrated dish washer,. smeg double oven, patio doors leading to the deck and back garden.\r\nUtility room: sink, range of units, plumbed for washing machine and dryer.\r\nDownstairs wc: whb and wc\r\n\r\nUpstairs:\r\nBedroom 1: 3.6m x 3.4m Laminate floor, wall to ceiling sliderrobes, ensuite with shower, wc and whb\r\nBedroom 2 3.4m x 3.2m Laminate floor, built in wardrobes\r\nBedroom 3: 3.5m x 3.5m Laminate floor, built in wardrobes\r\nBedroom 3: 3.3m x 3.2m Laminate floor\r\nBathroom: Fully tiled, bath, shower, whb & wc\r\nHotpress: shelved.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nSouthfacing back garden with deck and shed.\r\nOutdoor tap and electrical socket.\r\nCobblelock driveway to the front with parking for 2 cars."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
